      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "ואת הנערים יודעתי",
      "rationale": "'Ke ba tseboditše basha go lefelong' (ka go ba tsebisa) kgathanong le 'ke ba beile' (KJV 'appointed') — sebopego sa polelo ya Hiphil se ka bolela ka bobedi."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "פלני אלמוני",
      "rationale": "Mantšu a mabedi a 'mo go lêê — yoo le yoo' a swana ka modumo; ke gorelo-phaepe ya Seheberu ya go uta leina la lefelo."
    },
    {
      "kind": "secret",
      "subject": "taba ya kgoši",
      "rationale": "Dafida o uta taba ka bososo — 'motho a se ke a tseba selo se sengwe' — polelo ya dithušo."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme Dafida a re go Akhimeleke moperisita: Kgoši e ntšieletše taba, ya re go nna: Motho a se ke a tseba selo se sengwe ⟨את⟩ taba yeo ke go romelago yona, le yeo ke go laetšego; gomme ⟨את⟩ basha ke ba tseboditše go lefelong la yoo le yoo.",
